Package: berrykeep-server-node
Section: net
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: BerryKeep storage server node
 BerryKeep server node for the distributed storage platform workspace.
 This package ships the `berrykeep-server-node` service binary with the embedded
 server-admin web UI.
