Package: berrykeep-client
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!server-node-only>
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 fuse3
Description: BerryKeep client CLI and desktop helper applications
 This package ships the public `berrykeep` CLI together with the packaged client
 applications used for desktop workflows:
 `berrykeep-config-app`, `berrykeep-folder-agent`, `berrykeep-os-integration`,
 and the internal `berrykeep-background-launcher` helper.
Breaks: ironmesh-client (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces: ironmesh-client (<< ${binary:Version})

